        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Machine learning is a branch of artificial intelligence.\n",
            "\n",
            "Supervised learning uses labelled data.\n",
            "\n",
            "Unsupervised learning works with unlabelled data.\n",
